# Zahrat Manisa — Project Rule

This rule defines the core context and working principles for the Zahrat Manisa project.

## 1. Project Overview

Zahrat Manisa (زهرة مانيسا) is a digital travel platform initially focused on airline ticket search and booking.

The platform aims to simplify the customer journey from finding a flight to receiving and managing the issued ticket.

The long-term vision may expand into additional travel services such as:

- Hotel booking
- Transportation / Taxi
- Other travel-related services

These future services are not part of the initial scope unless explicitly approved.

---

## 2. Current Project Status

The project is currently in the analysis and planning stage.

Important:

- Proposed features are not automatically confirmed requirements.
- Do not assume that every feature mentioned in the documentation must be implemented.
- Do not invent missing business rules.
- Do not assume technical decisions that have not been confirmed.
- When an important decision is missing, identify it clearly before making a major implementation decision.

