# 4. Core Customer Flow

The primary customer journey is expected to be:

Search Flight
→ View Results
→ Select Flight
→ View Details
→ Enter Passenger Information
→ Payment
→ Booking Confirmation
→ Ticket Issued
→ Receive Ticket
→ Manage Booking

This represents the intended product direction and is not a finalized implementation specification.

